# Baseflo web — environment example
# Copy to `.env.local` only if you need to override defaults; in normal local
# dev you do NOT need a .env at all.

# ----- API base URL -----
# Where the SPA's gateway sends requests. Leave UNSET in local dev so requests
# are issued as relative paths (`/api/v1/...`) and Vite's dev-server proxy
# forwards them to the FastAPI server on :8000 (see vite.config.ts).
#
# Set this only when:
#   - You want to point the dev SPA at a deployed staging API.
#   - You're building a production bundle (Vite bakes the value at build time).
#
# Examples:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.staging.baseflo.com
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.baseflo.com
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
